@startuml

title UC8 - Ver o livro do dia

actor User
participant ":System" as System

User -> System: requestDailyBookScreen()
activate System

    System -> System: setupDailyBook()
    System --> User: displayShakeInstructions()
deactivate System

User -> System: (Abana o dispositivo)
activate System

    System -> System: detectShake()

    System --> User: displayDailyBook()
deactivate System

@enduml